  "merger_description": "Hyne Pallets Pty Ltd (Hyne Pallets) proposes to acquire the wooden pallet manufacturing business of Advance Pallets Pty Ltd (Advance Pallets) (the Acquisition).\n\nHyne Pallets\u2019 ultimate holding company is James Jones & Sons Ltd, a privately owned timber processing company headquartered in the United Kingdom.\u00a0 Hyne Pallets and its related entities operate an integrated timber processing business across Australia.\u00a0 It supplies a range of timber-related products, including timber framing, landscape, engineered wood products and wooden pallets. Hyne Pallets operates a wooden pallet manufacturing facility located in Tomago, New South Wales.\n\nAdvance Pallets is a wooden pallet manufacturer located in Smeaton Grange, in New South Wales.\u00a0Advance Pallets acquires the majority of the timber used to manufacture its wooden pallets from Hyne Group.",
